# Only the library itself belongs in the package. Without this, every consumer that pulls the loader
# through file:// (the example, the gitops fixture, the unit-test chart) packages the whole repo,
# including the other consumers' charts/*.tgz, so the tarballs nest inside each other and grow on
# every run until Helm refuses them.
.git
.github/
.gitignore
.helmignore
.markdownlint.yaml
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.yamllint
examples/
flake.lock
flake.nix
Taskfile.yml
test/
*.tgz
